      "questionText": "<p><strong>Drag and drop to complete the sentences.</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/exams/16028_8634fccf.png\" alt width=\"600\"></p>\n<p>1. The Hmong people are skilled farmers who grow a variety of <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.1</label><input id='fbo-899788-0' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='0' name='fbo-899788-0' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899788-0' /></span></strong>, including corn, rice, and vegetables.</p>\n<p>2. Visiting the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.2</label><input id='fbo-899788-1' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='1' name='fbo-899788-1' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899788-1' /></span></strong>&nbsp;is a great way to explore the daily life and culture of the Tay people.</p>\n<p>3. Many ethnic groups in Vietnam have unique <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.3</label><input id='fbo-899788-2' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='2' name='fbo-899788-2' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899788-2' /></span></strong>&nbsp;that explain the origins of the world.</p>\n<p>4. In the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.4</label><input id='fbo-899788-3' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='3' name='fbo-899788-3' type='text' size='20' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-899788-3' /></span></strong>, the Dao&nbsp;discussed ways to improve access to healthcare for people in the remote villages.</p>",
